  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Cast</strong> see replicated spell; dragonmark, somatic</p>\n<hr />\n<p>With a subtle manipulation of the powers of your mark, you can replicate simple cantrips to aid you.<br />    When you cast the Cantrip of the Handler you can choose @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.AfOpnnwdZwHi2Tnc]{Protect Companion} or @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.s7ILzY2xh1tc9U1v]{Tame}. Cantrip of the Handler gains the traits of the cast cantrip. You then replicate the cantrip's effect by completing the Cast a Spell activity using the normal number of actions. These cantrips are automatically heightened to the level of this spell. <br />    A spell cast by Cantrip of the Handler doesn’t require material or verbal components but always requires a dragonmark and somatic component.</p>"
    },
